  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Proyecto de Recuperacin del Ro Tiet Aguas Arriba de la Presa de la Penha, en el Estado de Sao Paulo  Renasce Tiet</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tiet River Recovery Project Upstream of the Penha Dam in the State of Sao Paulo - Renasce Tiet</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo del programa es contribuir a la recuperacin y preservacin del RioTiet. Los objetivos especficos son: (i) recuperacin y preservacin de las riberas del rio; (ii) mejora de la calidad del agua del rio; y (iii) fortalecimiento de la gestin de lainformacindelDAEEyde la gestin del parque Salespolis conparticipacin social.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the program is to contribute to the recovery and preservation of the Tiet River. The specific objectives are: (i) recovery and preservation of the riverbanks; (ii) improvement of river water quality; and (iii) strengthening the management of the information of the DAEE and the management of the Salespolis park with social participation.</narrative>
  </description>
